 The convex sapphire crystal is treated with nine layers of anti-reflective coating applied to both sides of the glass for increased legibility. The high standard of finish and attention to detail can be seen in the meticulous machining of the three-part cases which take considerable time and skill to apply.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBE-92AV automatic chronometer with 42-hour power reserve\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e34mm Polished stainless steel Trip-Tick® case construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater resistant to 10 ATM, 100 metres\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable on a variety of 16mm straps or polished stainless steel bracelet\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n      \u003c\/div\u003e\n    \u003c\/div\u003e\n    \n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"product-main-end\"\u003e  \n      \u003cdiv class=\"product-find\"\u003e\n        \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/store-locator\"\u003eFind a store\u003c\/a\u003e\n      \u003c\/div\u003e \n      \n      \n            \u003caside class=\"share-buttons\"\u003e  \u003cdiv class=\"share-buttons--list\"\u003e    \u003ca      class=\"share-buttons--button share-buttons--facebook\"      target=\"_blank\"      href=\"\/\/www.facebook.com\/sharer.php?u=https:\/\/www.bremont.com\/products\/solo-34-lc-white-alligator\"\u003e      \u003csvg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 19.485 19.564\"\u003e        \u003cpath id=\"FB\" fill=\"#071f2d\" d=\"M17.056,0H2.425A2.426,2.426,0,0,0,0,2.425V17.056a2.426,2.426,0,0,0,2.425,2.425H9.866V12.541H7.525V9.448H9.866v-1.5a4.038,4.038,0,0,1,3.93-4.18h2.174V7.19H14.046a.613.613,0,0,0-.669.669V9.448h2.592v3.093H13.377v7.023h3.679a2.426,2.426,0,0,0,2.425-2.425V2.425A2.326,2.326,0,0,0,17.056,0Z\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"\/\u003e      \u003c\/svg\u003e      \u003cspan class=\"show-for-sr\"\u003eShare on Facebook\u003c\/span\u003e    \u003c\/a\u003e    \u003ca      class=\"share-buttons--button share-buttons